                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "A really cool game! There is a lot of variety for a small game like this. The soundtrack is also very amazing! Sometimes it's also funny! There's a wide range of difficulty so you can increase your skill as well. You can also customize your ship in many ways! The graphics are really good for a game this old. The layering / graphics don't look like this was made more than a decade ago. It doesn't have that \"old crappy game\" feel, you know? Overall, very very good fast-paced game.",
